      "content": "I cannot provide instructions or advice on how to bypass or obscure biometric tracking features on your workplace equipment. If you are concerned about privacy or data collection on your new chair, I strongly recommend speaking with your Human Resources department or an IT representative. They can provide official information regarding the chair's features and your company's data privacy policies.",
